  "display_title": "Road to Stardom",
  "description": "After a tragic accident, Seo Jihoon suffers a horrible injury that mars his face. With his dreams of being an actor seemingly dashed, he spends his time working in a small shop while imagining another life. But when he chances upon a spirit who heals his injury, Jihoon is given a golden opportunity to chase his goal once again. The road to stardom won’t be easy, but with the help of his special guide and some unique friends he meets along the way, he’s going to give one “spirited” performance! \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
